  "extractionNotes": "Employee (0110, small employer). The case file centres on the Za życiem extension of parental leave 2025-10-14..2026-03-30 (24 weeks, 65 − 41), filed by the employer on 2025-09-30. Maternity 2024-10-15..2025-03-03 and parental 2025-03-04..2025-10-13 were already paid (stated in the refusal decision) and are recorded as paidBenefits; the plan holds only the extension. First decision (2025-11-05) refused: the three doctor's certificates were supplementary-leave hospital certificates, not the Za życiem certificate; it also explained the supplementary-leave transitional rule (on 2025-03-19 the claimant was on parental, not maternity, leave). On appeal with the correct certificate ZUS revoked its own decision on 2025-12-04 (USUS art. 83 ust. 6). Pregnancy sickness benefit: printed bases 3660.42 (daily 122.01, May 2024) and 3710.47 (daily 123.68, Oct 2024) at 100%, i.e. the full-time minimum-wage floor. Z-3 salary table 2023-02..2024-01 included (fixed + bonus columns); a third hospital stay (~January 2025) and the birth weight are uncertain and omitted. Employment start read as 2022-09-19 (one copy may read 2022-08-19). Rate of the maternity package not printed (leave application 20 days after birth suggests 81.5%)."
